Consider the function $f(t) = t^3 - 55t.$  Observe that the polynomial $f(t)$ has three roots 0, $\sqrt{55},$ and $-\sqrt{55}.$  Its graph is shown below.

[asy]
unitsize (0.2 cm);

real cubic (real x) {
  return ((x^3 - 55*x)/12);
}

